{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Requires the base game Abiotic Factor to access this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit mystery-laden ruins in the Temple of Stone - a Home World, which is a base-building portal location and a home-away-from-home. This pack also contains the official GATE Botanist uniform, which you can wear as you wander the hedge garden and ponder ancient, time-worn enigmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Home World Temple of Stone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Temple of Stone - a remote garden paradise, home to a series of petrified statues and classical architecture. Explore the winding hedge maze, wonder at the spectacles that once filled the amphitheatre, and reflect on its silent mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What were the ancient Greeks studying here, and why is GATE so interested?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026970/extras/dfa6dea93948998eddc21c9169109d34.poster.avif?t=1762192899\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026970/extras/dfa6dea93948998eddc21c9169109d34.webm?t=1762192899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026970/extras/dfa6dea93948998eddc21c9169109d34.mp4?t=1762192899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GATE Botanist Uniform</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Botanist Jacket with M/F versions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Botanist Jacket with Rolled Sleeves with M/F versions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Botanist Pants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Botanist Boots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Botanist Fabric / Tie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAnteverse Flower\u201d ID Card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosopher\u2019s Hairstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosopher\u2019s Beard&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Souvenirs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a piece of the Temple with you back to the GATE Cascade Research Facility, with some bespoke furnishings and other odds and ends exclusively found there:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wreath Circlet (hat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire Greek Armor set (for transmog)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stone Bench and Stone Bed furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret trapped within\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The server host is required to have the DLC in order to access the location. All players in the server can access the DLC location regardless of their DLC status.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026970?t=1762192899","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026970/c168f252dfde27aece4639b09823f1c049ef2da6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762192899","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026970/5388ffd567e740fd6803f886f72ee5b04e318ee9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762192899","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026970/5388ffd567e740fd6803f886f72ee5b04e318ee9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762192899","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"descr